UID:10002797-1781465400-1781470800@www.factorytheatre.ca
SUMMARY:PUNCH: A New Musical
DESCRIPTION:From Andrew Seok\, writer of ‘Rosamund’\, ‘Almost Ever After’\, ‘The Man With The Golden Heart’\, comes the story of a monkey that captured hearts across the world after being bullied and carrying his beloved IKEA plush toy everywhere he went. \n\n\n\nAbandoned at birth and raised by humans\, Punch grows up between two worlds\, never fully fitting into either. When released into a troop of 60 monkeys\, he searches for where he belongs\, and the courage to believe he is worthy of it. \n\n\n\nFeaturing: \n\n\n\nBELINDA CORPUZ as Momo \n\n\n\nCYRENA FIEL as Mama  \n\n\n\nCHILINA KENNEDY as The Narrator \n\n\n\nLARA RODA as Punch \n\n\n\nANDREW SEOK as Akira \n\n\n\nALEX WIERZBICKI as Dad \n\n\n\nHANEUL YI as The Zookeeper \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nWritten & Directed by: Andrew Seok \n\n\n\nMusic Director / Piano: Scott Metcalf \n\n\n\nPresented by: Chaos & Light Productions and Eclipse Theatre Company \n\n\n\nProducers: Andrew Seok\, M. Shane Aube \n\n\n\nConsulting Producer: Derrick Chua \n\n\n\nPoster Artwork & Design: Andrew Seok (Graphic Designer) / Forrest Young (Sketch Artist) / M.Shane Aube (Graphic Designer & Colourist) / H.Mac (Line Artist)Duration: 90 minutesAll ages \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nGet Tickets
URL:https://www.factorytheatre.ca/event/punch-a-new-musical/2026-06-14/
CATEGORIES:Rentals
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.factorytheatre.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/45c36756-2657-4796-8309-da37d707f57f.jpg
END:VEVENT
