UID:10002820-1781553600-1781559000@www.factorytheatre.ca
SUMMARY:Kitchen Potluck 2026
DESCRIPTION:fu-GEN’s longstanding annual tradition of Kitchen Potluck returns this season with three incredible writers\, three phenomenal dramaturges\, and a troupe of formidable actors to bring everything to life! Potluck began before fu-GEN was a company in 2002 — a small group of Asian Canadian artists would bring food\, gather\, and read new works they were writing and look for feedback and encouragement. This tradition has grown into the incredible community you see today\, encompassing hundreds of audience members\, and supporting hundreds of artists. Celebrating the Asian Canadian new play tradition while closing out another fu-GEN season\, we hope you can join us for an evening of joyous camaraderie\, delicious food\, and a wonderful party. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nPlaywrights:Lucy Coren\, Ho Ka Kei (Jeff Ho)\, Irene (Fan) YiDramaturges:Crystal Lee\, Tawiah M’Carthy\, Marie Beath BadianCast:Jeff Yung\, Lindsay Wu\, Jobina Sitoh\, Madelaine Hodges\, Jeff HoYour Co-Hosts:Nina Lee Aquino\, 郝邦宇 Steven Haofu-GEN Team:Artistic Director: David YeeManaging Producer: Marissa OrjaloResident Dramaturge: Andy ChengThank you to fu-GEN’s generous donors for their constant support:TD Ready Commitment\, The Wuchien Michael Than Foundation\, Canada Council for the Arts\, Ontario Arts Council\, Toronto Arts Council. Our programming is made possible through your belief in our mission.Duration: 75 minsAge Recommendation: 15+ \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nGET TICKETS
URL:https://www.factorytheatre.ca/event/kitchen-potluck-2026/
CATEGORIES:Rentals
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.factorytheatre.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/558dcdb1-abef-460b-a501-83640495bf05.jpg
END:VEVENT
